WEBVTT

01:18.610 --> 01:21.810
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.900 --> 01:24.830
[Episode 21]

01:31.330 --> 01:32.410
My landlady.

01:34.320 --> 01:35.289
My landlady.

01:36.630 --> 01:38.759
What are we having for dinner tonight?

01:40.400 --> 01:42.759
Aren't you trying to get in shape?

01:42.990 --> 01:44.990
Ever heard of not eating after noon?

01:45.200 --> 01:47.920
It'll help you get those abs.

01:48.710 --> 01:49.270
Really?

01:50.580 --> 01:52.430
I suggest, before you go on strike,

01:52.430 --> 01:53.750
you take a look at this

01:54.039 --> 01:54.970
and then decide.

01:55.880 --> 01:57.160
Comrade Li Fei.

02:02.790 --> 02:04.370
Aren't you going to
put your words together

02:04.370 --> 02:05.910
and praise the person in front of you?

02:05.910 --> 02:06.940
Osamu!

02:07.290 --> 02:08.690
The front-row seat!

02:11.360 --> 02:13.100
Thank you.

02:30.610 --> 02:31.850
That's awesome, bro.

02:31.870 --> 02:33.550
I really didn't treat you
so well for nothing.

02:33.550 --> 02:35.390
Tell you what,
tomorrow I'll go to the market

02:35.390 --> 02:36.280
and buy a bag of eggplants in bulk.

02:36.280 --> 02:37.410
I'll cook for you...

02:39.280 --> 02:40.610
What are you looking at?

02:41.850 --> 02:42.970
A bag of eggplants in bulk?

02:42.970 --> 02:43.720
Shut up.

02:43.740 --> 02:44.150
I...

02:44.329 --> 02:46.660
Delete your memory of what just happened.

03:00.130 --> 03:00.840
Anything else?

03:00.840 --> 03:01.630
Nothing.

03:02.110 --> 03:02.600
Thanks.

03:02.600 --> 03:03.640
Aren't you going home?

03:03.640 --> 03:04.920
I'm not done yet.

03:06.470 --> 03:06.920
Okay.

03:11.830 --> 03:12.830
Great.

03:14.520 --> 03:16.510
So far, of the nine hotels involved,

03:16.510 --> 03:17.280
seven have made

03:17.280 --> 03:19.130
public statements and responses.

03:19.130 --> 03:20.110
Four international hotels

03:20.110 --> 03:22.090
have adopted conservative solutions.

03:22.090 --> 03:23.440
They closed the comments
on their official Weibo,

03:23.440 --> 03:25.060
and claimed the video was fake.

03:25.060 --> 03:26.920
Two also announced that they will sue

03:26.920 --> 03:28.360
the Weibo blogger.

03:31.200 --> 03:33.350
Are you... not feeling well?

03:33.420 --> 03:35.660
Do you need me to continue reading?

03:38.300 --> 03:39.340
What about Shan Li Fang?

03:39.340 --> 03:41.440
As Vice President Liao's instructions,

03:41.440 --> 03:43.220
we followed closely
behind the international hotels

03:43.220 --> 03:44.950
and were the fifth
to release an open letter.

03:44.950 --> 03:47.480
We didn't admit to the behaviors
in the video.

03:47.680 --> 03:49.140
What is the situation now?

03:49.210 --> 03:50.690
Currently...

03:57.270 --> 03:59.060
I've been through it all.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.490
Just spit it out.

04:00.760 --> 04:01.880
This time,

04:01.900 --> 04:03.700
it's a bit different from before.

04:03.700 --> 04:05.430
Netizens are extremely angry.

04:05.550 --> 04:07.720
They suspect the involved hotels
of dodging responsibility.

04:07.720 --> 04:09.010
They also united the public

04:09.010 --> 04:10.660
to launch a joint boycott

04:10.690 --> 04:13.690
with a signature campaign
against these nine hotels.

04:29.600 --> 04:31.060
How does this outfit look?

04:32.190 --> 04:34.070
How many times have you paced
back and forth?

04:34.070 --> 04:35.580
He's on stage, and you're in the audience.

04:35.580 --> 04:36.480
He can't see you.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.520
What do you mean he can't see me?

04:37.520 --> 04:38.480
I will sit in the front row.

04:38.480 --> 04:41.490
He often interacts with the audience
in the front two rows.

04:41.490 --> 04:42.820
It's my first time meeting my idol,

04:42.820 --> 04:44.550
of course I need to look my best.

04:47.300 --> 04:48.830
You women,

04:49.870 --> 04:51.060
when you see your idol,

04:51.060 --> 04:52.630
you're more excited
than seeing your own husband.

04:52.630 --> 04:53.870
That's totally different.

04:53.870 --> 04:55.110
Alright, here you go.

05:02.840 --> 05:03.900
What are you doing?

05:04.790 --> 05:06.320
Why are you taking one back?

05:11.080 --> 05:11.940
What do you mean?

05:11.940 --> 05:14.140
Did you think both tickets were for you?

05:14.400 --> 05:15.520
You are too greedy.

05:15.520 --> 05:18.280
Do you know how hard it was
to get these two tickets?

05:18.280 --> 05:19.040
What else?

05:21.370 --> 05:23.410
I already made plans with someone.
Give the ticket...

05:23.410 --> 05:24.080
Why?

05:24.330 --> 05:25.990
If you took them all, then I...

05:26.390 --> 05:27.920
Then I don't get to watch it?

05:28.550 --> 05:30.520
Why would you watch it? Do you want to?

05:30.520 --> 05:32.310
Didn't you say before
that you didn't even know him?

05:32.310 --> 05:33.450
Aren't you interested? Give it to me.

05:33.450 --> 05:34.380
No.

05:34.450 --> 05:35.360
Give it to me.

05:35.990 --> 05:36.600
No.

05:36.620 --> 05:37.159
Give it to me.

05:37.159 --> 05:38.520
I love him.

05:40.600 --> 05:42.600
You know, getting these two tickets

05:42.800 --> 05:43.870
has completely sucked me in.

05:43.870 --> 05:45.800
I'm in too deep. I can't get out now.

05:48.610 --> 05:49.659
Is that a problem?

05:54.600 --> 05:55.230
Really?

05:58.020 --> 05:59.950
Fine, we'll go together.

06:00.990 --> 06:02.080
Are you even human?

06:06.320 --> 06:08.320
Right, how much were these tickets?

06:08.660 --> 06:11.320
You're talking about money
for our shared idol?

06:12.960 --> 06:14.230
That's so tacky.

06:16.810 --> 06:19.140
Just consider it
my New Year's gift to you.

06:21.060 --> 06:22.260
That's too generous.

06:22.260 --> 06:24.120
I still need to pay. How much is it?

06:26.790 --> 06:28.870
If you insist on talking about money,

06:29.990 --> 06:33.450
it's worth more than ten meals
of stir-fried eggplant strips.

06:34.900 --> 06:36.030
Three meals at most.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.090
Deal.

06:42.310 --> 06:43.140
Three meals.

06:48.380 --> 06:50.350
If it weren't for me taking care of them,

06:50.350 --> 06:53.680
these flowers definitely
wouldn't be blooming so well now.

06:53.750 --> 06:54.480
Exactly.

06:54.710 --> 06:57.370
Our Shiyu is really good at
everything she does.

06:58.510 --> 07:00.640
Even the flowers listen to you so well.

07:00.640 --> 07:01.970
Let alone other things.

07:02.640 --> 07:06.230
It seems this old man should make an exit

07:06.540 --> 07:07.840
to give you young people

07:07.840 --> 07:09.430
more time and space,

07:09.670 --> 07:12.070
so you won't think
I'm a bother or in the way.

07:12.600 --> 07:13.600
Hello, Chairman.

07:14.110 --> 07:16.910
Why call him Chairman at home?
Call him Uncle Liao.

07:18.240 --> 07:19.300
Hello, Uncle Liao.

07:20.600 --> 07:22.560
You are not an old man.

07:23.040 --> 07:25.570
You are the most handsome dad
in the universe.

07:25.670 --> 07:26.800
Have a seat, Ruohai.

07:28.580 --> 07:30.480
Such a sweet talker.

07:31.310 --> 07:33.310
You always know how to make me happy.

07:34.350 --> 07:34.990
Tell me.

07:35.310 --> 07:38.230
You called me over, buttered me up first,

07:38.720 --> 07:41.120
and now you're going to
tear into me, right?

07:41.750 --> 07:43.159
I know you too well.

07:44.600 --> 07:46.550
Let's cut to the chase.

07:47.040 --> 07:50.040
The online public opinion
is overwhelming this time.

07:50.130 --> 07:53.190
Is Shan Li Fang going to just sit
and wait for its demise?

07:55.640 --> 07:57.420
Uncle Liao, you're exaggerating.

07:57.420 --> 07:59.230
This incident may seem accidental,

07:59.230 --> 08:00.300
but I personally think

08:00.300 --> 08:02.280
someone did it on purpose.

08:02.990 --> 08:04.970
There is an account called point three.

08:04.970 --> 08:05.970
We looked into it.

08:06.350 --> 08:07.540
It was cultivated for thirteen months

08:07.540 --> 08:09.140
just for this one post today.

08:09.210 --> 08:11.390
Of course, the companies involved

08:11.410 --> 08:13.080
are mostly international hotel brands.

08:13.080 --> 08:14.280
So I personally think

08:14.280 --> 08:16.430
they are not targeting our Shan Li Fang.

08:16.430 --> 08:18.720
Shan Li Fang is just collateral damage.

08:18.980 --> 08:20.500
Therefore, this incident

08:20.530 --> 08:22.200
shouldn't affect us too much.

08:24.450 --> 08:25.190
Then,

08:25.790 --> 08:27.190
about the joint boycott,

08:27.540 --> 08:28.940
what's your take on that?

08:28.990 --> 08:31.440
Netizens these days are
under too much pressure.

08:31.440 --> 08:33.299
They are just using this incident

08:33.309 --> 08:35.580
as an outlet to vent.

08:35.610 --> 08:37.110
Time is the best medicine.

08:37.140 --> 08:39.470
So the best strategy to solve this problem

08:40.610 --> 08:41.640
is to do nothing.

08:43.770 --> 08:45.230
You can't stump Ruohai.

08:47.790 --> 08:49.920
It seems you've arranged everything.

08:50.610 --> 08:51.610
Of course.

08:52.370 --> 08:53.660
Naturally, Shan Li Fang

08:53.660 --> 08:55.200
isn't doing absolutely nothing.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.100
Internally, we must
investigate thoroughly.

08:57.100 --> 08:58.880
Similar incidents cannot happen again.

08:58.880 --> 08:59.680
Externally,

08:59.820 --> 09:00.890
we have also formulated

09:00.890 --> 09:02.570
various preferential policies.

09:02.570 --> 09:04.280
Netizens are the most forgetful.

09:04.280 --> 09:05.870
With these preferential policies,

09:05.870 --> 09:08.030
our turnover will soon recover.

09:08.950 --> 09:11.410
In summary, please rest assured, Chairman.

09:11.570 --> 09:12.480
Our team

09:12.510 --> 09:15.910
will definitely get through this crisis
as soon as possible.

09:16.050 --> 09:16.960
Surprised?

09:17.160 --> 09:17.830
Impressed?

09:18.560 --> 09:19.090
Good.

09:20.360 --> 09:21.470
Shiyu has grown up.

09:21.490 --> 09:22.820
With Ruohai's support,

09:23.010 --> 09:24.870
you can handle things on your own.

09:25.780 --> 09:26.930
It seems this time

09:27.420 --> 09:28.980
I was overly worried.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.470
You were clearly worried
about the company,

09:33.470 --> 09:34.670
yet you said

09:35.310 --> 09:37.720
you missed me and wanted a family dinner

09:38.070 --> 09:39.710
for the New Year.

09:43.830 --> 09:46.360
As a father, seeing my daughter happy

09:46.360 --> 09:47.920
is what matters the most.

09:50.820 --> 09:52.790
Don't just focus on work.

09:53.160 --> 09:55.420
Relationships, like work,

09:55.470 --> 09:58.220
also require you to manage them with care.

10:01.060 --> 10:02.450
I don't understand this.

10:02.450 --> 10:04.970
Are you in a hurry to marry me off?

10:06.040 --> 10:07.720
How could I bear to?

10:07.750 --> 10:09.310
I haven't spoiled you enough.

10:09.310 --> 10:10.400
Even if you marry,

10:10.590 --> 10:12.290
it has to be to someone

10:12.590 --> 10:14.190
who spoils you as much as I do.

10:16.170 --> 10:18.170
There is definitely no such person.

10:18.680 --> 10:20.610
Then I won't be able to get married.

10:25.120 --> 10:27.880
With that sweet mouth, you always win.

10:32.720 --> 10:35.730
[The play is fun. A small theater.]

10:32.790 --> 10:34.120
This is a crosstalk.

10:34.120 --> 10:34.590
Yes.

10:34.730 --> 10:36.800
I'm very happy to lead you out

10:36.830 --> 10:37.590
to perform for everyone.

10:37.590 --> 10:38.950
Am I an animal?

10:40.430 --> 10:41.950
Drag you up here?

10:42.400 --> 10:43.790
Isn't that still an animal?

10:43.790 --> 10:45.030
Pull you out?

10:45.120 --> 10:46.880
Am I a corpse? Pull me out?

10:48.160 --> 10:50.160
No, I mean they go down, you come up.

10:50.160 --> 10:50.710
This is called...

10:50.710 --> 10:52.640
That's called inviting me out.

10:52.760 --> 10:53.440
Right.

10:53.470 --> 10:55.000
Blowing you out.

10:55.020 --> 10:56.200
Am I snot?

11:00.720 --> 11:02.760
The ''invite'' as in "inviting you out".

11:02.760 --> 11:04.190
Inviting you out

11:04.190 --> 11:05.520
to continue performing for everyone.

11:05.520 --> 11:06.340
Exactly.

11:06.430 --> 11:09.640
This person here
is a very excellent loser.

11:09.640 --> 11:10.830
No, wait, what?

11:11.520 --> 11:13.450
Another slip of the tongue.

11:13.670 --> 11:14.880
Actor.

11:15.190 --> 11:18.190
Is it actor or loser?

11:19.120 --> 11:20.220
Old loser.

11:20.240 --> 11:21.840
Is "old loser" appropriate?

11:22.040 --> 11:23.760
It is actor, just kidding.

11:23.880 --> 11:25.040
Stop making jokes.

11:25.060 --> 11:25.730
I like you.

11:25.790 --> 11:26.360
Really?

11:26.360 --> 11:27.240
Let me praise you.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.120
Go ahead.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.950
You are, in the entire crosstalk world,

11:29.950 --> 11:31.400
the only head of

11:31.470 --> 11:32.950
a very famous actor.

11:32.950 --> 11:33.920
Alright, alright, alright.

11:33.920 --> 11:35.120
So I'm still an animal.

11:35.120 --> 11:37.120
That's poor wording.
What do you mean by "head"?

11:37.120 --> 11:38.380
A head, a flock.

11:38.470 --> 11:39.280
A duck?

11:39.710 --> 11:40.550
A strip?

11:40.950 --> 11:42.070
Am I a ribbonfish?

11:42.190 --> 11:44.790
A pile? A puddle? A blob?

11:44.790 --> 11:47.120
Fine. So I'm getting runnier and runnier?

11:48.880 --> 11:50.670
Am I not even solid anymore?

11:50.710 --> 11:52.000
No, I mean you are...

11:52.040 --> 11:53.500
That should be "an actor".

11:55.000 --> 11:56.920
Okay, okay, okay.

12:03.950 --> 12:05.950
A very excellent actor.

12:05.950 --> 12:06.710
Not at all.

12:06.790 --> 12:08.650
This can be witnessed.

12:08.760 --> 12:10.360
Look at all the friends here today.

12:10.360 --> 12:10.790
Yes.

12:10.790 --> 12:12.070
Not many like me.

12:12.240 --> 12:13.000
No way.

12:13.160 --> 12:13.890
Cute, right?

12:14.590 --> 12:15.400
What a good guy.

12:15.400 --> 12:17.670
A crosstalk show isn't lively
without jokes and laughter.

12:17.670 --> 12:18.160
Yes.

12:18.160 --> 12:20.710
We master four skills:
speaking, imitating, teasing, and singing,

12:20.710 --> 12:22.310
just to bring you joy.

12:22.310 --> 12:24.470
How about this? You give us an imitation

12:24.470 --> 12:25.590
in front of our friends.

12:25.590 --> 12:26.950
Try an imitation right here?

12:26.950 --> 12:27.590
Can you?

12:27.590 --> 12:28.360
No problem.

12:28.360 --> 12:30.160
Imitate something flying in the sky.

12:30.160 --> 12:31.160
Flying in the sky?

12:31.160 --> 12:32.240
Like what?

12:32.260 --> 12:33.420
A plastic bag.

12:34.590 --> 12:35.760
This silly girl,

12:35.760 --> 12:36.960
how can she ignore me?

12:37.310 --> 12:39.120
What's so good about this guy?

12:39.430 --> 12:41.460
[The play is fun. A small theater.]

12:40.710 --> 12:41.590
Sir, I like you so much.

12:41.580 --> 12:42.860
[Crosstalk is all about
speaking, imitating, teasing and singing.]

12:41.610 --> 12:42.570
Okay, come here.

12:42.710 --> 12:43.670
Sir, I really like you.

12:43.670 --> 12:44.930
Okay, thanks, thanks.

12:45.120 --> 12:47.280
Okay, come on, let's take a group photo.

12:47.280 --> 12:48.190
We'll take a picture together later.

12:48.190 --> 12:48.990
Okay, come on.

12:51.520 --> 12:52.430
Okay, thanks, thanks, thanks.

12:52.430 --> 12:54.190
Um, Osamu, I've liked you for a long time.

12:54.190 --> 12:55.160
Let's take a picture.

12:55.160 --> 12:56.260
Okay, no problem.

12:58.190 --> 12:59.040
Great, great.

13:00.530 --> 13:01.810
One more, one more.

13:02.670 --> 13:03.830
Okay, okay.

13:05.340 --> 13:09.160
[The play is fun. A small theater.]

13:05.550 --> 13:06.520
I finally get a photo,

13:06.520 --> 13:07.880
and you make me look so ugly.

13:07.880 --> 13:08.950
Who said that? Look at Osamu.

13:08.950 --> 13:11.350
-See, Osamu looks great.
-Osamu is so cute.

13:11.950 --> 13:14.590
I'm so happy today! I'm so excited!

13:16.360 --> 13:17.830
What about you? What about you?

13:17.830 --> 13:18.290
And you?

13:18.640 --> 13:19.950
Me too. I'm so happy!

13:19.950 --> 13:21.400
-I finally met Osamu!
-Right? Right?

13:21.400 --> 13:21.930
I'm so...

13:23.070 --> 13:23.790
Hopeless.

13:23.920 --> 13:24.880
What did you say?

13:25.070 --> 13:26.830
I'm saying Osamu is so
inspiring and talented.

13:26.830 --> 13:27.920
I like him so much.

13:27.950 --> 13:28.830
I... I... I...

13:28.830 --> 13:31.550
Yeah, unlike you,
pretending to be a rich second-gen.

13:31.550 --> 13:32.590
Hey, what do you mean by that?

13:32.590 --> 13:34.260
Biting the hand that feeds you?

13:34.260 --> 13:35.670
Who got the tickets for you? Forgot?

13:35.670 --> 13:38.070
You! Thank you, thank you!

13:38.070 --> 13:39.760
Tell you what,
let's go get some drinks tonight,

13:39.760 --> 13:40.920
since we don't have work tomorrow.

13:40.920 --> 13:42.830
Have a drink. It's fine if we get drunk.

13:42.830 --> 13:44.590
You're actually asking for a drink.

13:44.590 --> 13:45.590
Watch your image.

13:45.830 --> 13:46.510
Osamu!

13:48.000 --> 13:48.810
Osamu!

13:49.560 --> 13:50.400
Hurry up.

13:54.190 --> 13:55.280
Thank you.

13:58.040 --> 14:00.500
This is absolutely the best gift
I've received this year.

14:00.500 --> 14:02.560
I'll be happy for the whole next year.

14:02.880 --> 14:03.870
You're welcome.

14:04.470 --> 14:06.120
But I seem to remember

14:06.400 --> 14:07.900
someone told me

14:08.470 --> 14:09.930
as long as I get the ticket,

14:10.460 --> 14:11.790
she'd take my last name.

14:11.950 --> 14:12.670
Am I right?

14:14.870 --> 14:16.480
You actually misheard.

14:16.590 --> 14:18.670
I said I would change my last name,

14:18.690 --> 14:21.150
but I didn't say whose last name
I would take.

14:21.360 --> 14:23.160
You're playing word games, huh?

14:23.520 --> 14:24.650
Playing dirty, huh?

14:24.760 --> 14:25.640
You're the one

14:25.830 --> 14:28.350
who daydreamed and misinterpreted it.
Who's to blame?

14:28.350 --> 14:28.910
Fine.

14:29.880 --> 14:31.830
It's fine if you don't take my last name.

14:31.830 --> 14:33.360
But you have to change
your last name anyway.

14:33.360 --> 14:34.550
So, what will it be?

14:36.590 --> 14:37.830
I'll give you a choice:

14:37.830 --> 14:38.830
Tan.

14:39.400 --> 14:40.810
Tan Fei. How about that?

14:40.920 --> 14:41.880
Flick away, flick away!

14:41.880 --> 14:43.310
I'll flick you away! Flick you away!

14:43.310 --> 14:45.370
How about Wang Fei? Change it to Wang.

14:45.420 --> 14:46.070
Wang Fei is not bad.

14:46.070 --> 14:47.800
I actually quite like Wang Fei.

14:49.190 --> 14:51.830
If that really doesn't work,

14:53.190 --> 14:53.920
how about...

14:54.790 --> 14:56.650
I'll just take my dad's last name.

14:58.830 --> 15:00.790
Aren't you already taking
your dad's last name?

15:00.790 --> 15:01.550
No.

15:02.760 --> 15:04.240
Then whose last name do you have?
Your mom's?

15:04.240 --> 15:06.170
Yes. I changed my last name before.

15:08.040 --> 15:08.880
Really?

15:09.470 --> 15:11.200
Then what was your name before?

15:12.670 --> 15:13.400
Su Fei.

15:16.880 --> 15:17.950
Su Fei?

15:17.970 --> 15:19.640
I knew it! Laugh all you want.

15:19.950 --> 15:21.000
It's because you guys

15:21.000 --> 15:22.120
kept laughing and humiliating me

15:22.120 --> 15:24.050
that I was forced to change my name.

15:24.790 --> 15:26.330
To change this name back then,

15:26.330 --> 15:28.610
do you know how much
determination it took?

15:28.610 --> 15:29.640
This is absolutely

15:29.640 --> 15:31.020
the bravest decision
I've ever made in my life.

15:31.020 --> 15:32.150
I said back then,

15:32.310 --> 15:33.490
if I didn't change my name,

15:33.490 --> 15:34.890
I wouldn't go to college.

15:35.550 --> 15:37.710
So, this name

15:37.730 --> 15:39.680
carries so much blood and tears.

15:43.300 --> 15:43.990
However,

15:45.520 --> 15:46.880
after I changed my name,

15:47.400 --> 15:48.710
it was still no good.

15:50.130 --> 15:52.330
I found I couldn't save money, you know?

15:53.210 --> 15:56.220
You know? Qian Fei, Qian Fei.

15:56.250 --> 15:57.420
Do you know why?

15:57.470 --> 15:58.640
"Owe fee."

15:59.160 --> 16:01.330
The money either flies away
or gets owed out.

16:01.330 --> 16:02.390
How could I keep it?

16:03.760 --> 16:06.120
When you changed your last name back then,

16:06.140 --> 16:08.120
why didn't you change your first name too?

16:08.120 --> 16:10.120
It'd be so nice to be called Qian Lai.

16:10.550 --> 16:12.400
No, my dad said

16:12.400 --> 16:14.860
my name was calculated
by a fortune-teller.

16:16.000 --> 16:18.950
Based on the Five Elements,
he said I was missing...

16:19.830 --> 16:20.780
I don't remember.

16:20.780 --> 16:22.840
Anyway, he said I couldn't change it.

16:23.120 --> 16:23.880
I know.

16:24.930 --> 16:25.730
I think

16:27.040 --> 16:28.360
in your Five Elements,

16:29.160 --> 16:30.760
you're missing a brain cell.

16:31.280 --> 16:32.520
You're the one missing a brain cell!

16:32.520 --> 16:33.300
I'll kick you to death.

16:33.300 --> 16:34.760
Kick you to death, I swear!

16:35.310 --> 16:36.430
Want to kick me?

16:43.400 --> 16:44.590
Brainless.

16:45.760 --> 16:47.350
Did you take

16:47.650 --> 16:49.110
my golden advice to heart?

16:55.800 --> 16:57.060
Your phone is ringing.

17:06.089 --> 17:07.280
[Jinzi]

17:09.750 --> 17:10.550
Hello, Jinzi.

17:13.349 --> 17:15.810
What's wrong?
Figure out how to pay you back?

17:15.950 --> 17:17.670
Not yet, it's another thing.

17:20.810 --> 17:23.300
So many romantic prospects.

17:24.160 --> 17:24.760
Thank you.

17:35.670 --> 17:38.530
He even closes the door,
who wants to listen anyway?

17:47.210 --> 17:48.180
Where are you going?

17:48.180 --> 17:49.580
Going on a date this late?

17:51.750 --> 17:53.950
A date? What date? I have business to do.

17:55.750 --> 17:58.120
Um, you've been drinking, so don't drive.

17:58.270 --> 17:58.950
Got it.

18:05.590 --> 18:06.220
Wait.

18:06.950 --> 18:07.640
Um...

18:08.230 --> 18:09.360
Be nice to her.

18:09.570 --> 18:12.030
Talk nicely,
don't lose your temper easily.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.400
Unless she's like me,

18:14.720 --> 18:16.380
I really have no rent to refund you

18:16.380 --> 18:18.110
and put up with living with you.

18:18.800 --> 18:20.330
What are you talking about?

18:21.120 --> 18:21.950
Don't lock the door.

18:21.950 --> 18:22.950
I'll be right back.

18:22.950 --> 18:24.810
You're not staying out all night?

18:33.120 --> 18:34.920
Fei Fei.

18:36.910 --> 18:39.170
Being in love really makes a difference.

18:39.600 --> 18:41.840
One second we were talking fine,

18:42.790 --> 18:43.750
and the next,

18:44.800 --> 18:46.320
he just up and leaves.

18:47.690 --> 18:49.420
So much for loyalty to friends.

18:58.030 --> 18:59.600
Why do I feel a little upset?

19:21.300 --> 19:22.820
[Dad]

19:26.430 --> 19:27.470
Hello, Dad.

19:27.730 --> 19:29.390
It's so late, you're still up?

19:29.950 --> 19:31.380
Your mom's in emergency surgery right now.

19:31.380 --> 19:32.910
Can you come back tomorrow?

19:34.160 --> 19:35.240
What happened?

19:36.320 --> 19:37.710
Wasn't her condition already stable?

19:37.710 --> 19:40.120
Your mom heard that
you and Qian Fei broke up,

19:37.820 --> 19:41.640
[Surgery Staff]

19:40.710 --> 19:41.770
and her blood pressure shot up.

19:41.770 --> 19:43.810
Tonight, she suddenly had chest pain.

19:43.810 --> 19:45.990
I took her to the hospital,
and the checkup showed

19:45.990 --> 19:47.600
the main artery in her heart

19:47.620 --> 19:48.940
is 90% blocked.

19:49.430 --> 19:51.730
They went straight into emergency surgery.

19:51.730 --> 19:52.830
Okay, I got it.

19:53.360 --> 19:53.920
Look,

19:54.060 --> 19:56.390
I'll book the first flight back tomorrow.

19:56.750 --> 19:58.210
I'm booking now. Gotta go.

20:10.200 --> 20:11.650
[Qian Fei]

20:16.700 --> 20:17.250
[Wang Ruohai]

20:18.290 --> 20:19.240
Wang Ruohai?

20:22.470 --> 20:23.160
Hello?

20:23.380 --> 20:24.070
Qian Fei.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.640
Let me ask you something.

20:29.510 --> 20:30.990
Did you tell my mom

20:31.320 --> 20:32.360
that we broke up?

20:33.490 --> 20:34.630
Of course not.

20:34.840 --> 20:36.430
I called to check in

20:36.430 --> 20:37.640
on your mom's health.

20:38.120 --> 20:38.800
But

20:38.800 --> 20:41.030
it seemed you didn't tell them the truth.

20:41.030 --> 20:42.430
So I made an excuse.

20:43.160 --> 20:43.880
Qian Fei.

20:44.710 --> 20:46.400
We've already broken up.

20:47.860 --> 20:49.770
Could you please stop showing concern

20:49.770 --> 20:51.170
for my mom in your own way?

20:51.440 --> 20:52.700
My mom doesn't need it.

20:53.010 --> 20:54.470
None of my family needs it.

20:54.810 --> 20:55.890
I'm telling you, Qian Fei,

20:55.890 --> 20:58.440
my mom doesn't need
your hypocritical care.

20:58.520 --> 21:00.050
If you have any conscience,

21:00.270 --> 21:02.600
stay away from my family
from now on, okay?

21:04.800 --> 21:06.190
What are you talking about?

21:06.190 --> 21:07.920
Li Yifei, why are you here?

21:08.840 --> 21:10.170
Hang up the phone first.

21:12.230 --> 21:13.510
Hello? Hello?

21:17.840 --> 21:19.950
Didn't Li Yifei go to see a girl?

21:19.970 --> 21:21.970
Why did he go to Wang Ruohai's place?

21:23.360 --> 21:24.640
Bastard.

21:33.510 --> 21:35.310
The number you have dialed is...

21:41.150 --> 21:44.450
[Qian Fei]

21:52.260 --> 21:55.920
[Qian Fei]

22:07.650 --> 22:08.800
[Qian Fei]

22:10.430 --> 22:11.400
You've hit me,

22:12.180 --> 22:13.440
and vented your anger.

22:14.930 --> 22:16.050
Let's talk.

22:16.160 --> 22:17.360
Why did you beat me up?

22:22.640 --> 22:23.880
Why did I beat you up?

22:24.600 --> 22:26.770
Do you know what two kinds of men
I hate the most?

22:26.770 --> 22:27.400
First,

22:29.160 --> 22:32.020
those who play dirty tricks
behind people's backs.

22:32.990 --> 22:33.640
Second,

22:36.030 --> 22:37.600
those who step on their women

22:37.600 --> 22:38.840
to climb the ladder.

22:42.430 --> 22:43.800
You're both.

22:45.190 --> 22:46.670
You edited the video so well.

22:46.670 --> 22:48.600
Who else should I beat up if not you?

22:49.100 --> 22:51.430
What's the relationship between you two?

22:51.600 --> 22:52.860
None of your business.

23:02.080 --> 23:03.940
I'm warning you for the last time.

23:04.230 --> 23:06.360
If you dare to mess with Qian Fei again,

23:07.160 --> 23:09.020
it won't be as simple as a beating.

23:37.400 --> 23:38.530
You're still awake?

23:38.640 --> 23:39.400
You're back.

23:42.990 --> 23:44.230
What do you mean? This is my home.

23:44.230 --> 23:45.430
Where else would I go?

23:48.290 --> 23:48.980
Wait, wait.

23:52.510 --> 23:54.040
What happened to your face?

23:56.640 --> 23:59.250
That girl was so hard to deal with,
you know?

23:59.320 --> 24:01.710
A few words in and she messed up my face.

24:01.750 --> 24:02.810
Can you believe it?

24:03.480 --> 24:05.470
Young people nowadays are
really not to be messed with.

24:05.470 --> 24:06.950
So that's your type?

24:07.490 --> 24:10.150
Your taste is getting
more and more particular.

24:10.600 --> 24:11.430
Like it or not,

24:11.480 --> 24:12.920
I might as well try more while I'm young.

24:12.920 --> 24:15.250
At least I won't have regrets
when I'm old.

24:19.700 --> 24:20.890
Hey, come here.

24:25.270 --> 24:26.600
Your face

24:26.620 --> 24:29.220
looks like you've been
constipated for a week.

24:30.140 --> 24:31.290
Just spit it out.

24:31.310 --> 24:32.260
Don't hold it in.

24:32.670 --> 24:33.800
Are you trying to ask me how things went

24:33.800 --> 24:34.950
with that girl?

24:36.230 --> 24:38.090
Are you just curious,

24:38.120 --> 24:40.120
or a little jealous?

24:43.270 --> 24:44.800
You went to see Wang Ruohai.

24:48.990 --> 24:50.230
Impressive.

24:50.750 --> 24:51.600
You found out so quickly

24:51.600 --> 24:53.510
that I went on a date
with your ex-boyfriend?

24:53.510 --> 24:54.440
You guys fought?

25:01.510 --> 25:03.990
I just couldn't stand
seeing my landlady get bullied.

25:03.990 --> 25:05.600
That's it. Simple as that.

25:13.840 --> 25:15.660
Well, wait here.

25:15.910 --> 25:17.360
Let me treat your wound.

25:18.120 --> 25:20.720
No need, it's just a minor injury.

25:21.320 --> 25:22.580
It doesn't hurt at all.

25:22.950 --> 25:24.470
You didn't even see what he looked like.

25:24.470 --> 25:25.270
No need to treat it.

25:25.270 --> 25:26.030
No, no, no.

25:26.030 --> 25:27.290
It doesn't hurt at all.

25:45.930 --> 25:47.230
[The surgery was a success.
Your mom is fine.]

26:24.080 --> 26:24.560
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

26:24.560 --> 26:25.840
I barely dare to touch it.

26:25.840 --> 26:27.430
Be gentle, it hurts.

26:29.520 --> 26:30.580
Bear with it.

26:30.600 --> 26:32.130
Be gentle, it really hurts.

26:34.840 --> 26:35.770
Feeling better?

26:35.930 --> 26:36.750
Oh my god.

26:37.030 --> 26:38.880
Hang in there, just one more.

26:39.670 --> 26:41.250
One more? There's more?

26:41.600 --> 26:43.200
I need to disinfect it again.

26:43.320 --> 26:44.190
Don't move. Don't move.

26:44.190 --> 26:45.520
Seriously, do not move.

26:45.670 --> 26:47.670
The more you move, the more it hurts.

26:50.060 --> 26:54.260
♪ No need to guess the ending
right from the beginning ♪

26:56.890 --> 27:02.300
♪ Let the melody play
among the chords and the wind ♪

27:04.880 --> 27:10.460
♪ And no need to demand
that yesterday keeps its promises ♪

27:11.650 --> 27:17.150
♪ Leave some surprises in life
to the unknown ♪

27:20.060 --> 27:25.220
♪ There's no need to make a judgment
based on a few past ♪

27:26.100 --> 27:31.760
♪ Somehow I feel a little disappointed
That's why I create poems ♪

27:34.890 --> 27:40.390
♪ There's no need
to give up for the past ♪

27:35.270 --> 27:35.840
Well...

27:39.800 --> 27:41.080
Okay, that's... that's enough.

27:41.080 --> 27:41.980
Go on.

27:41.280 --> 27:46.800
♪ I need some courage to get praises ♪

27:42.360 --> 27:43.320
Get some sleep.

27:43.350 --> 27:45.240
Yes, it's done.

27:47.640 --> 27:50.690
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

27:49.000 --> 27:50.460
Thanks for today.

27:51.100 --> 27:52.570
For standing up for me.

27:51.330 --> 27:54.440
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

27:53.120 --> 27:54.750
And also, thank you

27:54.790 --> 27:56.130
for spending New Year's Eve with me.

27:55.510 --> 28:01.620
♪ Dumb shoulder Like a harbor
waiting for you ♪

27:57.670 --> 27:58.920
Are you drunk?

27:58.940 --> 28:01.330
Today is the 30th. Tomorrow is the 31st.

28:01.400 --> 28:03.100
The day after tomorrow is New Year's Day.

28:03.100 --> 28:05.390
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

28:04.080 --> 28:06.400
Yeah, I got it wrong.

28:06.420 --> 28:09.460
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

28:10.430 --> 28:12.050
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

28:11.510 --> 28:13.270
Well... then tomorrow night,

28:12.880 --> 28:15.620
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

28:13.270 --> 28:16.160
you'll be spending New Year's
with your friends, right?

28:16.160 --> 28:16.840
Landlady,

28:18.640 --> 28:19.710
how about tomorrow

28:20.710 --> 28:22.970
you make me stir-fried eggplant strips?

28:23.120 --> 28:24.640
I'll come back early.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.510
Then we can have dinner together,

28:26.510 --> 28:27.570
and watch the news.

28:28.140 --> 28:29.400
This way, neither of us

28:29.840 --> 28:33.870
♪ Also, there's no need
to force the closest bonds ♪

28:30.120 --> 28:31.850
has to spend the New Year alone.

28:35.560 --> 28:36.190
Okay.

28:36.670 --> 28:37.470
Sure.

28:36.850 --> 28:41.620
♪ I might be left alone,
but I have your warmth ♪

28:38.360 --> 28:38.950
Um...

28:39.800 --> 28:42.120
Well, good night. Get some sleep.

28:42.640 --> 28:43.300
Good night.

28:44.890 --> 28:49.970
♪ And there's no need to dwell
on right or wrong—not because of fear ♪

28:51.770 --> 28:57.440
♪ A hug far outweighs endless apologies ♪

28:58.170 --> 29:00.600
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

29:01.440 --> 29:04.690
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

29:03.750 --> 29:04.880
Suddenly I feel like

29:05.320 --> 29:06.320
this winter

29:05.960 --> 29:12.070
♪ Dumb shoulder Like a harbor
waiting for you ♪

29:06.950 --> 29:09.130
is the warmest winter I've had

29:09.510 --> 29:11.040
in all my years in Shanghai.

29:13.260 --> 29:15.130
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

29:16.100 --> 29:19.380
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

29:17.080 --> 29:17.740
Good night.

29:21.180 --> 29:23.440
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

29:25.160 --> 29:32.190
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

29:31.030 --> 29:37.210
[Zela Dance Studio]

29:32.030 --> 29:34.290
It's just a demonstration for everyone.

29:34.320 --> 29:35.320
Don't be nervous.

29:36.100 --> 29:36.780
Right.

29:37.480 --> 29:38.540
Okay, let's start.

29:40.470 --> 29:43.030
Thank you for coming
to our open house today.

29:43.120 --> 29:44.400
Zela Dance Studio

29:44.400 --> 29:47.130
is a dance studio
specializing in hip-hop dance.

29:47.160 --> 29:49.120
Since many of our senior friends

29:49.120 --> 29:50.600
are also interested in learning,

29:49.140 --> 29:50.270
[Zela Dance Studio]

29:50.630 --> 29:51.990
we've specially arranged

29:51.990 --> 29:54.880
a demonstration session today.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.430
We have both hip-hop and square dance

29:56.430 --> 29:57.710
for you to choose from.

29:57.840 --> 29:59.710
Let's start with hip-hop.

30:00.080 --> 30:00.670
Music.

30:26.080 --> 30:27.470
It's this teacher.

30:27.490 --> 30:29.710
My friend took private lessons with her,

30:29.710 --> 30:32.470
and won first prize
in the senior group last year.

30:32.470 --> 30:33.390
Really?

30:33.880 --> 30:36.470
My grandson is her student now.

30:36.490 --> 30:40.120
He was chosen as the president
of the dance club at his school.

30:52.470 --> 30:54.470
Amazing! So good!

30:54.610 --> 30:56.150
She dances really well.

30:56.400 --> 30:57.560
That rhythm is even more intense

30:57.560 --> 30:59.120
than square dancing.

31:10.600 --> 31:11.800
Please fill in your name, phone number,

31:11.800 --> 31:13.130
-and the course you'd like to enroll in.
-You danced so well.

31:13.130 --> 31:14.200
Can I learn it?

31:14.220 --> 31:15.660
-Your phone number and the course
-Of course you can.

31:15.660 --> 31:18.260
-you'd like to enroll in.
-Anyone can learn it.

31:18.840 --> 31:21.260
-I think that...
-As for private lessons,

31:21.410 --> 31:23.630
-we should learn square dance.
-I think...

31:23.630 --> 31:24.660
You can take a look first.

31:24.660 --> 31:25.990
-What's the key?
-The key is

31:25.990 --> 31:28.710
-I've been quite thorough in analysis
-to see whether you have...

31:28.710 --> 31:29.880
of dance movements.

31:29.950 --> 31:31.140
-I'll add extra classes.
-Yeah. Right.

31:31.140 --> 31:33.100
For instance, when I give extra lessons,

31:33.100 --> 31:34.100
they're all free.

31:35.510 --> 31:36.950
Make-up lessons are free.

31:36.950 --> 31:39.470
Right, I think here's the thing:

31:39.490 --> 31:42.030
-if you don't get it in the first class...
-You can ask first if you can book.

31:42.030 --> 31:42.750
Ms. Yu.

31:42.750 --> 31:43.600
Book a trial class.

31:43.600 --> 31:45.230
I want to learn dance from you
with my grandson,

31:45.230 --> 31:46.960
but my lower back isn't good.

31:46.980 --> 31:47.800
Your lower back isn't good?

31:47.800 --> 31:48.190
Right.

31:48.190 --> 31:50.130
Look, if your lower back isn't good,

31:50.130 --> 31:52.230
you definitely shouldn't do
that dance style.

31:52.230 --> 31:52.880
Because

31:52.880 --> 31:54.710
that dance has very intense music.

31:54.710 --> 31:56.290
It's really hard on your lower back.

31:56.290 --> 31:57.950
For my grandson, I can bear it.

31:58.030 --> 32:00.140
You obviously don't have a grandson,
you wouldn't understand.

32:00.140 --> 32:02.140
No, I'm telling you.

32:03.230 --> 32:05.400
Whether you have a grandson or not

32:05.420 --> 32:06.430
has nothing to do with your lower back.

32:06.430 --> 32:08.480
-I mean you don't understand my feelings.
-Auntie. Auntie.

32:08.480 --> 32:10.560
-Auntie. Auntie. Don't!
-I want to sign up...

32:10.560 --> 32:12.430
Don't be angry, listen to me.

32:12.430 --> 32:13.430
Here's the thing.

32:13.830 --> 32:15.430
Given the condition of your lower back,

32:15.430 --> 32:18.030
I really don't recommend you
learn dance from me.

32:18.030 --> 32:19.840
But our square dance room

32:19.840 --> 32:21.400
is right next to mine.

32:21.400 --> 32:23.230
-Really?
-If you want to accompany your grandson,

32:23.230 --> 32:25.880
you can take square dancing
and still be with him.

32:25.880 --> 32:27.470
And the class is on the same day.

32:27.470 --> 32:28.510
How does that sound?

32:28.510 --> 32:30.570
That works. You have a way with words.

32:31.190 --> 32:33.160
It's all about mutual understanding.

32:33.160 --> 32:35.490
That teacher was also looking out for you.

32:35.710 --> 32:37.360
I speak without thinking sometimes.

32:37.360 --> 32:38.430
I'll go sign up now.

32:38.460 --> 32:39.880
Yes, go sign up first.

32:39.920 --> 32:41.120
I'll head over, okay?

32:41.120 --> 32:42.120
Go sign up.

32:43.600 --> 32:45.190
Ma'am, I'm sorry.

32:45.340 --> 32:47.390
Ms. Yu just told me about it.

32:47.410 --> 32:49.040
I'll just sign up with you.

32:49.950 --> 32:51.710
I'd be happy to have you sign up.

32:52.990 --> 32:53.800
What's your name?

32:53.800 --> 32:54.920
My name is Fang...

32:55.660 --> 32:57.590
Ying, the "Ying" that means novel.

32:58.230 --> 32:58.630
Right.

33:07.920 --> 33:08.710
Jingjing.

33:13.500 --> 33:14.560
Jingjing, it's me.

33:19.910 --> 33:20.670
Jingjing.

33:31.670 --> 33:32.430
Fei.

33:32.840 --> 33:34.640
Do you know where Jingjing went?

33:36.950 --> 33:38.260
Okay, okay.

33:43.930 --> 33:45.550
[See you at the internet cafe later.]

33:45.990 --> 33:47.510
Where do you live?

33:48.400 --> 33:49.990
How about we drop you off first?

33:49.990 --> 33:52.230
I live farther than you,
let's drop you off first.

33:52.100 --> 33:52.990
[I'll send you the location later.]

33:58.510 --> 33:59.880
Thank you for earlier.

34:00.460 --> 34:02.590
It's nothing. Just telling the truth.

34:03.670 --> 34:06.270
Have you been learning dance
since childhood?

34:06.360 --> 34:09.170
Yes, in Yunnan, people of all ages

34:09.199 --> 34:11.170
love singing and dancing from a young age.

34:11.170 --> 34:12.710
If you have a chance to visit again,

34:12.710 --> 34:14.639
you might even fall in love with it.

34:19.510 --> 34:22.550
I think the air and scenery in Yunnan

34:22.550 --> 34:24.780
are indeed quite good.

34:24.800 --> 34:26.710
But I feel that in every aspect,

34:27.320 --> 34:28.719
compared to Shanghai...

34:30.989 --> 34:32.630
I'm just telling the truth.

35:05.550 --> 35:06.990
Okay, does the top look empty to you?

35:06.990 --> 35:08.470
Should we add some balloons or something?

35:08.470 --> 35:09.470
I don't think that's necessary.

35:09.470 --> 35:11.360
No need for the top.
Just leave it as it is.

35:11.360 --> 35:13.320
-Okay, sure.
-Adding more might not be safe anyway.

35:13.320 --> 35:15.380
-Okay.
-In case something falls off.

35:17.020 --> 35:18.420
Brother-in-law is here.

35:19.510 --> 35:21.330
Go over it on your end.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.150
Jingjing.

35:27.510 --> 35:28.840
What are you doing here?

35:34.250 --> 35:35.990
I went to your place to look for you,
but you weren't there.

35:35.990 --> 35:37.520
Qian Fei said you were here.

35:50.010 --> 35:50.720
Forgive me.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.950
Can we go somewhere else to talk?

36:04.200 --> 36:05.530
I'm very busy right now.

36:06.030 --> 36:07.070
Just a moment,

36:07.470 --> 36:08.270
just a moment.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.800
I dissolved the company.

36:26.430 --> 36:27.320
You were right.

36:28.130 --> 36:30.190
I've been reflecting on this lately.

36:30.990 --> 36:32.280
Before, I was busy
with my startup every day,

36:32.280 --> 36:33.940
caught up in company matters,

36:34.400 --> 36:36.330
and I neglected our life together.

36:36.850 --> 36:38.510
But during that time, I didn't know.

36:38.510 --> 36:39.240
I thought,

36:39.610 --> 36:41.610
I thought that was everything to me.

36:43.200 --> 36:44.720
But after calming down,

36:46.990 --> 36:49.650
I realized that
the most important thing is you.

36:49.790 --> 36:50.310
So,

36:52.430 --> 36:54.160
after dissolving the company,

36:54.880 --> 36:56.410
I don't want anything else,

36:57.720 --> 36:59.120
I just want to be with you.

37:04.210 --> 37:05.760
Aren't you going to hold on

37:05.790 --> 37:08.320
until the product is developed
and launched?

37:10.430 --> 37:11.080
I'm sorry.

37:12.950 --> 37:14.360
I was wrong before.

37:19.550 --> 37:20.840
Will you forgive me?

37:40.870 --> 37:46.620
♪ Whenever I look up ♪

37:45.200 --> 37:46.050
Jingjing.

37:47.220 --> 37:48.700
After closing the company,

37:47.840 --> 37:53.560
♪ I ran into your eyes ♪

37:48.920 --> 37:50.450
I might not have much money.

37:50.630 --> 37:51.630
In the short term,

37:51.760 --> 37:53.490
I can't give you a luxury house or car,

37:53.490 --> 37:55.580
but I will work hard
to make your life worry-free.

37:55.260 --> 38:00.820
♪ Trying to catch that pleasant light ♪

37:56.430 --> 37:58.790
From now on, I'll put you first,

37:58.880 --> 38:00.360
put our life first.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.070
So, Jingjing,

38:02.410 --> 38:08.160
♪ To embrace that fleeting moment
of happiness ♪

38:05.320 --> 38:06.360
will you marry me?

38:10.180 --> 38:16.100
♪ Sometimes I cry,
and sometimes I'm happy ♪

38:18.050 --> 38:23.700
♪ Sometimes I feel
I've captured the sweetness ♪

38:25.420 --> 38:31.280
♪ Sometimes, I run,
and sometimes, I fall ♪

38:30.030 --> 38:31.960
I don't mind that you have no money.

38:32.480 --> 38:38.650
♪ Sometimes I feel
that having you is the best thing ♪

38:32.680 --> 38:34.810
I don't mind that your startup failed.

38:40.550 --> 38:45.750
♪ I've never loved anyone
like I love you ♪

38:42.030 --> 38:43.630
But I don't want to marry you.

38:46.680 --> 38:47.400
I'm sorry.

38:47.130 --> 38:53.710
♪ Without any hesitation ♪

38:54.870 --> 39:01.070
♪ I've never been loved like you love me ♪

39:02.560 --> 39:08.410
♪ In short, I'll wait for my love ♪

39:10.540 --> 39:15.960
♪ I've never seen a bright sea like you ♪

39:17.430 --> 39:23.880
♪ Every minute is colorful ♪

39:25.970 --> 39:31.030
♪ I've never experienced
such a warm love as yours ♪

39:32.170 --> 39:40.710
♪ In short, I won't let go of my hand ♪

39:43.320 --> 39:44.240
You're back.

39:46.110 --> 39:47.120
Such a feast!

39:47.240 --> 39:48.430
Here, give it to me.

39:53.380 --> 39:54.070
Hello?

39:54.950 --> 39:57.430
Fei, come keep me company.

39:58.470 --> 39:59.240
Just now,

40:00.920 --> 40:02.800
Lu Ze proposed to me again,

40:03.630 --> 40:04.830
and I turned him down.

40:04.920 --> 40:06.720
Okay, okay, I'll be right there.

40:08.350 --> 40:09.230
Well,

40:09.430 --> 40:11.700
I can't make stir-fried eggplant strips
for you today.

40:11.700 --> 40:13.760
You can eat out with your girlfriend.

40:15.760 --> 40:16.840
What?

40:16.950 --> 40:19.080
I'll spend tonight with someone else.

40:19.150 --> 40:20.330
Don't wait up for me.

40:22.720 --> 40:23.150
Hold on, hold on.

40:23.150 --> 40:25.210
What? What girlfriend? I...

40:29.110 --> 40:30.360
Stood me up?

40:32.010 --> 40:32.790
Fine.

40:33.630 --> 40:34.490
Unbelievable.

40:41.070 --> 40:42.110
Stood me up.

40:52.660 --> 40:55.390
Hey, let's ring in the New Year
together tonight!

41:01.990 --> 41:03.150
Hoes over bros.

41:06.430 --> 41:08.090
What kind of people are these?

41:16.470 --> 41:17.770
Hey, organize a gathering.

41:17.770 --> 41:20.570
Let's celebrate New Year's Eve
together tonight.

41:20.630 --> 41:21.350
Li Yifei.

41:21.970 --> 41:23.360
You called me back late last night saying

41:23.360 --> 41:24.620
no gathering tonight.

41:24.720 --> 41:27.510
And now you're telling me
the gathering is back on.

41:27.510 --> 41:28.470
Jerk.

41:28.590 --> 41:31.450
Are you just banking on me
not cutting ties with you?

41:32.240 --> 41:33.300
Alright, alright.

41:33.430 --> 41:34.280
Stop it.

41:34.720 --> 41:36.450
I'm not in a good mood right now.

41:36.510 --> 41:38.550
What's wrong? What happened?

41:38.550 --> 41:39.960
Who pissed you off?

41:40.110 --> 41:41.500
Stop asking. Just gather the guys.

41:41.500 --> 41:42.900
Round everyone up.

41:43.430 --> 41:45.630
Let's get wild tonight!

42:32.280 --> 42:33.510
I'm so exhausted.

42:35.240 --> 42:36.720
When I told Lu Ze

42:37.820 --> 42:39.540
that I wouldn't marry him,

42:41.970 --> 42:43.820
I just felt completely drained.

42:48.590 --> 42:50.200
What is happening to me?

42:51.970 --> 42:53.640
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.200 --> 42:54.940
Alright.

42:54.970 --> 42:56.180
Happy New Year.

42:56.480 --> 42:57.140
Good night.

42:57.750 --> 42:58.330
They're fighting.

42:58.330 --> 42:59.060
They're fighting.

42:59.060 --> 42:59.960
They're fighting.

42:59.960 --> 43:00.550
Stop, stop!

43:00.550 --> 43:02.080
Don't. Don't open the door.

43:02.320 --> 43:03.860
What's going on?

43:04.960 --> 43:07.430
I just have to capture a moment like this.

43:08.450 --> 43:11.670
What are you doing? I'm already like this.

43:11.690 --> 43:12.690
Cross-arm toast!

43:12.800 --> 43:13.650
Cross-arm toast!

43:13.650 --> 43:14.210
No, no.

43:14.240 --> 43:14.780
Cross-arm toast!

43:14.780 --> 43:16.270
I'm a guy.

43:16.300 --> 43:17.440
It's fine if you joke about me.

43:17.440 --> 43:18.600
But don't joke about Jinzi.

43:18.600 --> 43:19.330
She's a girl.

43:19.340 --> 43:20.600
-I don't mind.
-Right?
